# Slide decks

When asked to create a presentation, copy a template into `presentations/<slug>/index.html`. Do not link shared CSS, JS, or fonts.

1. Read `templates/<name>/TEMPLATE.md`. Default template: `charla`.
2. Copy `templates/<name>/template.html` to `presentations/<slug>/index.html`.
3. Keep `<style>`, `<script>`, and the SVG sprite unchanged.
4. Replace the `<section class="slide">` elements. Delete unused layouts.

```html
<section class="slide bullets">
  <header class="bar"><h2>Título</h2></header>
  <div class="body"><ul><li>Una idea.</li></ul></div>
</section>
```

Images go in `presentations/<slug>/assets/` and are referenced as `assets/<file>`. The folder travels together. Inline a data URI only when the deck must be a single file.
